<div class="page-header">
  <h1>Site settings</h1>
</div>

<a href="/admin">&larr; Back to dashboard</a>

<form class="stack" method="POST" action="/admin/settings/general" style="margin-top:18px; max-width:480px;">
  <div class="field">
    <label for="schoolName">School name</label>
    <input type="text" id="schoolName" name="schoolName" value="<%= settings.schoolName || '' %>" required />
  </div>
  <div class="field">
    <label for="mascot">Mascot</label>
    <input type="text" id="mascot" name="mascot" value="<%= settings.mascot || '' %>" />
  </div>
  <div class="field">
    <label for="tagline">Header tagline</label>
    <input type="text" id="tagline" name="tagline" value="<%= settings.tagline || '' %>" />
  </div>
  <div class="form-actions">
    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Save</button>
  </div>
</form>

<h2 style="margin-top:36px;">Admin username & password</h2>
<p class="lede">For security, the admin username and password are set as environment variables (<code>ADMIN_USERNAME</code> and <code>ADMIN_PASSWORD</code>) rather than stored here. See the setup guide for how to change them on Railway.</p>
